@RaceDay.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5289

### 1. Register a new Organiser
POST {{RaceDay.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "RaceOrganizer",
  "email": "organizer@raceday.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "role": "Organiser"
}

### 2. Login to get JWT Token
# @name loginRequest
POST {{RaceDay.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organizer@raceday.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### (Save the token from the login response for secured requests below)
@authToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.token}}

### 3. Get All Events (Public)
GET {{RaceDay.API_HostAddress}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create a New Event (Organiser Only)
POST {{RaceDay.API_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Pretoria City Half Marathon 2026",
  "description": "Annual 21km community run through Pretoria.",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-15T08:00:00Z",
  "location": "Union Buildings, Pretoria",
  "organiserId": 1
}

### 5. Get All Categories
GET {{RaceDay.API_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json